<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-MAZHEIKIU IN 7 MO 30 MLN LITAS PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-MAZHEIKIU IN 7 MO 30 MLN LITAS PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					 ( Amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Profit before taxes	   30.024    vs losses 42.105</p>
<p>    Turnover			  1.331 bln vs	 500.42</p>
<p>Notes: The Vilnius bourse decided on Monday to list</p>
<p>Mazheikiu Nafta oil refinery on the A group of the stock</p>
<p>exchange from August 25.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
